# W10s, member b (k10, replaying at most 200 steps a second): with a west; stays when a leaves; follows at @322 s:
# a JOIN of a's stag0102 stage group (about 50 s of ticks, a catch-up of about 22 s); staff remove b at @334 s while it
# catches up; a leaves the stage at @338 s: b falls back from nobody's instance and goes home on its own story.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@91
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log in the field
route {route:stag0101_west:-280,-190}
wander -280 -190 6 until present=1 fail stagechange
log a left
wander -280 -190 6 until epoch>=@322 fail stagechange
log b follows
mat matz02 yes until stagechange
log b loads stag0102
idle until stage=stagml11,control
log b home
idle until frames>=600
